    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.poster.avif?t=1729004800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.webm?t=1729004800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.mp4?t=1729004800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After falling down the magical Narra tree inside his bahay kubo (nipa hut), it\u2019s up to Kata to rebuild and carry his house to the top of the tree \u2014 but he can\u2019t do it alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Kata as he climbs up and ventures through different areas representing major themes in Filipino culture. Prepare to meet a wide cast of characters based on Filipino nature and mythology to help \u2014 or mislead \u2014 Kata on his journey. Learn skills stemming from Filipino art forms and craftsmanship to traverse around and across the wonders and perils of the Narra tree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/16032c1f7f8c66894564fbb9942232f2.avif?t=1729004800\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive Platforming Movement</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and dash your way  across and up the magical Narra tree! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Minigames &amp; Puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve, endure, and overcome challenging minigames and puzzles relating to various themes and art forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Narrative</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tells a compelling story that focuses on Filipino themes such as community, hospitality, and bayanihan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Filipino Cultural Art</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and delve into Filipino art forms such as visual arts, dance, theatre, and literature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Environmental Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique areas inspired by diverse Filipino arts, cultures, peoples, animals, and more; all presented through hand-drawn art and topped with their own background music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wide range of characters! They will join you on your journey, helping you carry your house and teaching you new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscene Animatics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story through endearing hand drawn animatics! Watch the story unfold and charm not only your eyes, but your heart as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel while accompanied by modern arrangements of traditional Filipino folk music, inspired by local composers such as Augusto Espino and Bernardino Custodio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/5d4ead0883498e2a4ec4e42957a61a21.avif?t=1729004800\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.poster.avif?t=1729004800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.webm?t=1729004800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/462681c1a28d35e95b7d571f5ec3bdee.mp4?t=1729004800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After falling down the magical Narra tree inside his bahay kubo (nipa hut), it\u2019s up to Kata to rebuild and carry his house to the top of the tree \u2014 but he can\u2019t do it alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Kata as he climbs up and ventures through different areas representing major themes in Filipino culture. Prepare to meet a wide cast of characters based on Filipino nature and mythology to help \u2014 or mislead \u2014 Kata on his journey. Learn skills stemming from Filipino art forms and craftsmanship to traverse around and across the wonders and perils of the Narra tree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/16032c1f7f8c66894564fbb9942232f2.avif?t=1729004800\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive Platforming Movement</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and dash your way  across and up the magical Narra tree! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Minigames &amp; Puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve, endure, and overcome challenging minigames and puzzles relating to various themes and art forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Narrative</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tells a compelling story that focuses on Filipino themes such as community, hospitality, and bayanihan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Filipino Cultural Art</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and delve into Filipino art forms such as visual arts, dance, theatre, and literature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Environmental Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique areas inspired by diverse Filipino arts, cultures, peoples, animals, and more; all presented through hand-drawn art and topped with their own background music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wide range of characters! They will join you on your journey, helping you carry your house and teaching you new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscene Animatics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story through endearing hand drawn animatics! Watch the story unfold and charm not only your eyes, but your heart as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel while accompanied by modern arrangements of traditional Filipino folk music, inspired by local composers such as Augusto Espino and Bernardino Custodio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561870/extras/5d4ead0883498e2a4ec4e42957a61a21.avif?t=1729004800\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
